prediction.statement:
For a feed-forward classifier with C classes whose final layer is Linear(h_last -> C) followed by softmax cross-entropy, trained on n points, let P be the total parameter count. Then:
  (1) the structural gauge dimension is g = h_last + 1, INDEPENDENT of C;
  (2) rank(J_train) = min( n*(C-1), P - g );
  (3) d_free = max( 0, P - g - n*(C-1) ).
